stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Open: report incident<br/>any authenticated user

    Open --> UnderInvestigation: assign investigator<br/>RR, RMD, RO, ADMIN
    UnderInvestigation --> Resolved: corrective actions complete<br/>root cause required
    Open --> Resolved: minor event, no investigation<br/>RMD, CRO, ADMIN
    Resolved --> Closed: sign-off<br/>SUPERVISOR, CRO, RMD, ADMIN
    Resolved --> UnderInvestigation: reopen (new evidence)
    Closed --> [*]

    note right of Open
        Required on create: title, event_date,
        discovered_date, event_description,
        severity. reported_by auto-stamped.
    end note

    note right of UnderInvestigation
        Guard: owner_id must be set.
        Capture root_cause, financial_impact,
        operational_impact, immediate_response.
    end note

    note right of Resolved
        Guard: root_cause and corrective_actions
        non-empty. resolution_date / resolved_at
        auto-stamped by the app layer.
    end note

    note right of Closed
        Terminal. Guard: lessons_learned recorded
        and risk_posture set. Crystallized events
        keep risk_id linked to the parent risk.
    end note
